  "writeAlgorithm": [
    "Validate and detach the complete candidate with validateFoodCashPaymentEvidenceVersion.",
    "Require cash_evidence_version exactly 1.",
    "Read the exact physical-order id/version through FOOD-008B.",
    "Map FOOD-008B not-found or invalid to invalid; map FOOD-008B storage-failure to storage-failure.",
    "Require validateFoodCashPaymentEvidenceAgainstOrder to succeed against the exact durable order snapshot.",
    "Read the exact durable cash_evidence_id/cash_evidence_version before insert using explicit normalized columns and LIMIT 2.",
    "If one authenticated existing row is canonically equal to the candidate, return already-present without writing.",
    "If one authenticated existing row differs in any semantic field, return conflict without writing.",
    "If duplicate, malformed or otherwise unclassifiable durable rows are observed, fail closed and do not write.",
    "If no exact durable row exists, execute one ordinary INSERT only.",
    "If that INSERT succeeds, return created with a detached deeply frozen canonical value.",
    "If INSERT throws or its result is uncertain, reread the exact durable identity once.",
    "An exact canonical raced row after uncertain INSERT returns already-present.",
    "A divergent exact raced row after uncertain INSERT returns conflict.",
    "If no classifiable exact durable row exists after the single reread, return storage-failure.",
    "Never blindly retry a write.",
    "Never UPDATE, DELETE, REPLACE or UPSERT cash evidence history."
